[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0747","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0747.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21288","title":"Microsoft Windows COM Server 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows COM 服务器组件存在信息泄露漏洞，源于 COM 服务器在使用未初始化的资源（CWE-908）时未能正确处理内存对象，导致敏感信息被不当暴露。具有低权限的本地认证攻击者可通过在受影响系统上运行特制应用程序来利用此漏洞，获取本不应被访问的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019/2022/2025 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21288"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050061），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2008~2025 全系列，更新后对应版本号分别为 10.0.10240.20890（1507）、10.0.14393.7699（1607/2016）、10.0.17763.6775（1809/2019）、10.0.19044.5371（21H2）、10.0.19045.5371（22H2）、10.0.22621.4751（11 22H2）、10.0.22631.4751（11 23H2）、10.0.26100.2894（11 24H2/Server 2025）、10.0.20348.3091（Server 2022）。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/13ed3f592a10631c0caaa49cbae4f7b3f5d02049/2025/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21288","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21288.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21288"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0747.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0134","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0134.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"JeecgBoot 框架 passwordChange 接口任意用户密码重置漏洞","description":"JeecgBoot 是一款基于代码生成器的 Java 企业级低代码开发平台。其 /jeecg-boot/sys/user/passwordChange 接口存在水平越权漏洞，未对当前用户身份与目标用户进行一致性校验，导致未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接构造包含 username 和 newPassword 参数的 HTTP 请求，在无需旧密码或验证码的情况下任意修改包括管理员在内的任意用户密码，从而完全接管系统后台，造成敏感数据泄露和系统控制权丧失。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-01de5c17"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-01-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"1. 升级 JeecgBoot 至官方已修复版本（≥3.7.0），官方已在后续版本中为 passwordChange 接口添加权限校验注解，确保用户只能修改自身密码；2. 对于无法升级的版本，在 Nginx 或网关层配置访问控制，限制 /jeecg-boot/sys/user/passwordChange 接口仅允许已认证用户访问；3. 在业务代码中增加当前登录用户与会话中 username 的一致性校验，防止水平越权绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.xway.cn/bug/vulnerability.php?id=216"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0843","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0843.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21380","title":"Microsoft Azure Marketplace SaaS Resources 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Azure Marketplace SaaS 资源存在访问控制不当漏洞（CWE-284），已获得 Azure 订阅访问权限的授权攻击者可利用该漏洞通过网络向目标 SaaS 资源发送特制请求，绕过预期的权限检查机制，实现信息泄露。根据 Microsoft 的评估，该漏洞在机密性、完整性和可用性三方面均造成高影响（CVSS 8.8），攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互。受影响产品为 Azure Marketplace SaaS，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21380"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-09T23:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:14Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已于 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复了 Azure Marketplace SaaS 资源的访问控制缺陷，服务端已自动部署修复，用户无需手动安装补丁。建议用户立即审查 Azure 订阅中 Marketplace SaaS 资源的 RBAC 角色分配，移除不必要的特权访问权限，启用 Azure Activity Log 审计并定期检查异常访问行为。如使用自定义角色，确保遵循最小权限原则，限制对 SaaS 资源管理端点的网络访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21380","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21380.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21380.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21380.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21380.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0843.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0848","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0848.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21385","title":"Microsoft Purview 服务器端请求伪造信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Purview 存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞（CWE-918），授权攻击者可利用该漏洞向内部网络资源发送特制请求，从而越权读取敏感信息。攻击者需具备有效身份认证，无需用户交互即可通过网络远程利用。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Purview 数据治理与合规服务，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快安装补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21385"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-09T22:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:15Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已通过服务端更新修复 Microsoft Purview 中的 SSRF 漏洞，用户无需手动操作，Purview 服务会自动更新至修复版本。作为深度防御措施，建议在 Purview 扫描规则中限制出站网络目标，仅允许访问白名单内的内部服务端点，并启用网络隔离策略防止 SSRF 横向移动。同时监控 Purview 的异常出站请求日志，及时发现利用尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21385","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21385.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21385.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2025/CVE-2025-21385.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21385.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21385.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e6513c0b48a121b576b654c0b00e8a0bc6d72f6d/2025/CVE-2025-21385.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2025/CVE-2025-21385/CVE-2025-21385.sh","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21385.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21385.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-21385.md","https://github.com/Pauloxc6/CVE-2025-21385"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0848.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0007","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0282","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10923,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10941}}","description":"Ivanti Connect Secure（22.7R2.5 之前版本）、Ivanti Policy Secure（22.7R1.2 之前版本）以及 Ivanti Neurons for ZTA 网关（22.7R2.3 之前版本）的 Web 组件存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-121/CWE-787）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标设备的受影响服务发送特制的恶意网络请求，触发栈上缓冲区溢出并覆盖返回地址，从而在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码，实现完全远程代码执行。该漏洞无需合法凭据、无需用户交互，攻击条件仅需网络可达目标设备的监听端口，危害等级为严重（CVSS 9.0），已被公开利用，影响大量部署上述网关的企业远程接入与零信任架构。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0282"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-01-08T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Ivanti Connect Secure 升级至 22.7R2.5 或更高版本，Ivanti Policy Secure 升级至 22.7R1.2，Ivanti Neurons for ZTA gateways 升级至 22.7R2.3。若暂无法升级，须运行 Ivanti 外部完整性检查工具 (ICT) 进行威胁狩猎，发现异常立即断网并执行工厂重置，同时重置管理员密码、API 密钥及本地用户密码，在防火墙层面限制管理接口访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://forums.ivanti.com/s/article/Security-Advisory-Ivanti-Connect-Secure-Policy-Secure-ZTA-Gateways-CVE-2025-0282-CVE-2025-0283","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/ivanti-connect-secure-vpn-zero-day","https://www.cisa.gov/cisa-mitigation-instructions-cve-2025-0282","https://github.com/sfewer-r7/CVE-2025-0282","https://labs.watchtowr.com/exploitation-walkthrough-and-techniques-ivanti-connect-secure-rce-cve-2025-0282/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-0282","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?search_api_fulltext=CVE-2025-0282","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52213","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-0282.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-0282.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-0282.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-0282.yaml","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Ivanti/CVE-2025-0282/README.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/9e669818e6334d592d44717c5ec3d75ca4cc97e4/data/2025/CVE-2025-0282-44xo_CVE-2025-0282.md","https://github.com/sfewer-r7/CVE-2025-0282/blob/e1a46435a7175b9a6cee56f5a9fd4f0646e69182/CVE-2025-0282.rb","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/b15267648d6c329465c8b4cfbeb7597850ead8c1/2025/2025.01/CVE-2025-0282%EF%BC%9AIvanti%20Connect%20Secure%20%E6%A0%88%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2025-01/%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%20Ivanti%20Connect%20Secure%20RCE%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20%EF%BC%88CVE-2025-0282%EF%BC%89%20%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%20PoC.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-0282.rules","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/6ca38245cd4f76ea240e519a68d43bb56ac01013/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-03-10-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/absholi7ly/CVE-2025-0282-Ivanti-exploit","https://github.com/watchtowrlabs/CVE-2025-0282","https://github.com/Hexastrike/Ivanti-Connect-Secure-Logs-Parser","https://github.com/AnonStorks/CVE-2025-0282-Full-version","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-0282"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0378","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0291","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器 V8 JavaScript 引擎的 Turboshaft 优化编译器存在类型混淆漏洞，具体位于 WasmGCTypeAnalyzer 组件对单块循环（single-block loop）的 WebAssembly GC 类型分析过程中。该漏洞由 V8 引入的 WasmGC Turboshaft 优化功能所触发，通过 Chrome 遥测功能（Finch trial, `V8WasmTurboshaft`）以 100% 概率向 Chrome 128 至 131 版本推送。攻击者利用精心构造的 WebAssembly GC 代码，在循环中操纵 Wasm 结构体（struct）局部变量类型，使得类型分析器误判变量类型，从而在后续的类型转换中产生类型混淆，实现内存地址泄漏与伪造对象（addrOf/fakeObj ）原语，最终可逃离 Chrome 渲染进程沙箱并执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击者远程构造恶意 HTML 页面诱使用户用受影响的 Chrome 版本打开即可触发，影响 Google Chrome 128 至 131 版本中所有未修复（低于 131.0.6778.264）的安装实例，CVSS v3.1 评分为 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已于 2025 年 1 月发布 Chrome 131.0.6778.264 版本修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级。该漏洞同时也影响 Microsoft Edge 等基于 Chromium 的浏览器。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0291"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T19:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 131.0.6778.264 或更高版本，基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Brave、Opera）需同步更新至各自对应修复版本。可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成升级，或从官网下载安装包手动更新。无法立即升级时，可禁用 V8 JIT 编译作为临时缓解措施（通过启动参数 --jitless），但会显著影响性能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/383356864","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0291.md","https://github.com/Petitoto/chromium-exploit-dev/blob/73186ef6546fc1eeff094ae33e6703c3cf83a528/vulns/memcor/CVE-2025-0291.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0291.json","https://github.com/HackTricks-wiki/hacktricks/blob/c93bee2f1ab8e3376a98604a9c0232d6a90249fb/src/binary-exploitation/chrome-exploiting.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0291.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0291","https://github.com/0ca/BoxPwnr-Traces/blob/37d5f44cdbc275e629f96a02ff6fda8e17ff9425/exploitbench/v8-cve-2025-0291/traces/20260716_090914/notes.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-0291.md","https://github.com/zavora-ai/adk-rust/blob/e46e388ac9f764cafd5a34138a3d484f68bf5836/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-vh5q-rxqq-3f32/GHSA-vh5q-rxqq-3f32.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0378.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0378.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0160","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0160.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"浪潮 云财务系统 AllotOrderSrv.asmx 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"浪潮云财务系统 AllotOrderSrv.asmx Web 服务接口存在反序列化漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 SOAP 请求，利用 .NET 反序列化机制在服务器上执行任意代码。攻击者无需认证即可发送精心构造的 SOAP 消息到该接口，通过恶意序列化对象实现远程代码执行，可完全控制服务器。影响浪潮云财务系统多个版本，攻击向量为网络远程调用，无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-0241f6e7"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-01-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即联系浪潮官方技术支持获取云财务系统安全补丁并升级至最新版本。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或反向代理层面封禁对 /AllotOrderSrv.asmx 接口的外网访问，仅允许内网受信 IP 调用；禁用 .asmx 服务中不必要的 SOAP 方法；开启 Web 服务的请求参数严格校验和反序列化白名单机制；监控该接口的异常调用日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2025-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/hw-poc/hw-poc-2025-0241f6e7","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-0160"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/hw-poc/hw-poc-2025-0241f6e7"],"exp_urls":["https://github.com/hw-poc/hw-poc-2025-0241f6e7"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0894","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0894.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21614","title":"go-git 客户端 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"go-git 是一个用纯 Go 语言编写的高度可扩展的 Git 实现库。在 v5.13 之前的版本中发现存在拒绝服务（DoS）漏洞。攻击者可通过向 go-git 客户端提供恶意构造的 Git 服务器响应，触发客户端资源耗尽，导致服务不可用。该漏洞影响 go-git v4 及更高版本的所有用户。攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程利用此漏洞，只需控制或伪造一个 Git 服务器并向目标客户端发送特制响应即可触发。受影响版本包括所有 v4.x 至 v5.12.x 的 go-git 版本。建议用户将 go-git 升级至 v5.13 版本以修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21614"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:51Z","remediation":"建议将 go-git 升级至 v5.13.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。对于 Go 项目，可通过执行 go get github.com/go-git/go-git/v5@latest 更新依赖；若使用 Go modules，请修改 go.mod 文件中 require github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 v5.13.0 后运行 go mod tidy。如因兼容性无法立即升级，可临时限制不可信 Git 服务器的连接或禁用对不受控仓库的自动克隆功能以降低攻击面。升级后建议重新编译并测试应用功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/go-git/go-git/security/advisories/GHSA-r9px-m959-cxf4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21614.md","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/c348feb0d5996a102890f14e55ccc2ae3c992313/security/vex/fleet/CVE-2025-21614.vex.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21614.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21614.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/blob/748a639b1d436a0566d325a4233ca13baf4cbd60/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21614.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21614.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21614.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-21614.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-21614.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0894.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0893","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0893.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21613","title":"Go go-git URL 字段参数注入漏洞","description":"go-git 是一个用纯 Go 语言编写的高度可扩展的 Git 实现库。该库在 v5.13 之前的版本中存在参数注入漏洞，当使用文件传输协议时，程序会调用外部 git 二进制文件，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 URL 字段向 git-upload-pack 命令注入任意参数，从而可能导致未授权的代码执行或数据泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 go-git 且通过文件传输协议进行仓库操作的应用，CVSS v4.0 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。官方已在 go-git 5.13.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21613"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 go-git 到 v5.13.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复参数注入漏洞。对于 Go 项目，执行 go get github.com/go-git/go-git/v5@v5.13.0 更新依赖版本，或修改 go.mod 文件将 go-git 依赖版本号设为 v5.13.0 后运行 go mod tidy 重新下载依赖。对于使用其他包管理工具的项目，按对应工具更新 go-git/v5 包至 v5.13.0+。如无法立即升级，可临时在应用层对 file transport protocol 的 URL 参数进行严格白名单校验，过滤或转义包含连字符（-）等特殊字符的 URL，防止注入 git-upload-pack 恶意参数。同时建议在代码审查中排查所有使用 go-git file transport 协议克隆或操作仓库的代码路径，确认 URL 来源可信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/go-git/go-git/security/advisories/GHSA-v725-9546-7q7m","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21613.md","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/c348feb0d5996a102890f14e55ccc2ae3c992313/security/vex/fleet/CVE-2025-21613.vex.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21613.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21613.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/blob/748a639b1d436a0566d325a4233ca13baf4cbd60/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/96c1e5030cd59d2e06d8a9c9959ff981a1b632c6/doc/2025-01/【漏洞预警】Gogit Go-Git 未授权表达式注入漏洞 (CVE-2025-21613).md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21613.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21613.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-21613.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-21613.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0893.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0222","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0222","title":"IObit Protected Folder IUProcessFilter.sys IOCTL处理程序空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IObit Protected Folder 13.6.0.5及之前版本中，驱动程序IUProcessFilter.sys的IOCTL处理程序在0x8001E000/0x8001E004功能号处理时存在空指针解引用漏洞。本地攻击者可通过发送特制IOCTL请求触发空指针解引用，导致系统蓝屏崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞需本地低权限用户身份访问，已公开PoC利用代码，厂商IObit未做出回应。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0222"],"sources":["cve","vuldb"],"published":"2025-01-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"厂商IObit未发布官方补丁，建议升级Protected Folder至13.6.0.5以上版本，限制非授权用户对IUProcessFilter.sys驱动的IOCTL调用权限，部署驱动程序访问控制策略以降低本地拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-0222","https://vuldb.com/?id.290201","https://shareforall.notion.site/IOBit-Uninstaller-IUProcessFilter-0x8001E000-NPD-DOS-15260437bb1e809c81bbc484c53b17bc","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.290201","https://vuldb.com/?submit.466956"],"poc_urls":["https://shareforall.notion.site/IOBit-Uninstaller-IUProcessFilter-0x8001E000-NPD-DOS-15260437bb1e809c81bbc484c53b17bc"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0809","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-71387","title":"Trend Micro TrendAI Vision One 不正确权限分配权限提升漏洞","description":"TrendAI Vision One 的 Service Gateway 注册处理逻辑中存在不正确的权限分配漏洞（CWE-266）。该漏洞允许已通过身份认证的远程攻击者利用 Service Gateway 注册过程中的权限校验缺陷，将自身权限提升至本应受保护的高敏感资源访问级别。攻击者只需具备低权限账户即可通过网络远程触发该漏洞，无需用户交互。该漏洞影响 Trend Micro TrendAI Vision One 产品，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Trend Micro 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-71387"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"确保 TrendAI Vision One Service Gateway 已更新至 2025 年 12 月或之后的月度维护版本（SaaS 平台自动推送，无需手动操作）。如未启用自动更新，请在管理控制台中开启月度维护自动更新功能。作为临时缓解措施，审查并限制可执行 Service Gateway 注册操作的用户角色，仅授予必要的最小权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cyberdudebivash-pvt-ltd/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2b0626f5e465171e71082169b1dfac186a2f5e41/cve/CVE-2025-71387.html","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash-pvt-ltd/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2b0626f5e465171e71082169b1dfac186a2f5e41/api/intel/cve/CVE-2025-71387.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/2a9248802d0ef764cd9d8d36e8aa0a4d050daa1d/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/695f74e4e3ab9f7c4448908de5b0c1ff3ae1e78b/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-498.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-31.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/vulndb/vulns/jvn/2026/07/VW-2026-37579.yaml","https://github.com/skbnw/y_body/blob/0d181d3644386ae8bd7ac49df3aa0ce9b53dfe7b/2026-0804/20260804-scan.csv","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/e6720adb8b6bafb13f88b679ac0e19ce241b221f/news/2026/07/2026-07-29.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/data/vendors/jvn/advisories/2026/https-jvn.jp-vu-jvnvu98815601/advisory.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/data/vendors/jvn-ipedia-ipa/advisories/2026/https-jvndb.jvn.jp-en-contents-2026-jvndb-2026-026086.html/advisory.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0809.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0807","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0807.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-71386","title":"Trend Micro Vision One Service Gateway 日志信息泄露漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Vision One 的 Service Gateway 模块存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于系统将敏感数据（如凭据、会话令牌等）以明文形式记录在日志文件中，具有低权限的远程攻击者可通过网络访问获取这些日志，从而窃取敏感信息。由于攻击影响范围跨越安全边界（Scope: Changed），泄露的敏感信息可被用于进一步攻击内部系统。该漏洞需认证后方可利用，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。Trend Micro 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-71386"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"确认 TrendAI Vision One Service Gateway 已启用自动更新（默认开启），系统会自动接收后端侧修复。若已关闭自动更新，请在管理控制台重新启用自动更新策略，或联系 Trend Micro 支持获取手动更新包进行安装。作为临时缓解措施，可在网络防火墙上限制对 Service Gateway 管理端口的非授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cyberdudebivash-pvt-ltd/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2b0626f5e465171e71082169b1dfac186a2f5e41/cve/CVE-2025-71386.html","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash-pvt-ltd/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2b0626f5e465171e71082169b1dfac186a2f5e41/api/intel/cve/CVE-2025-71386.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/2a9248802d0ef764cd9d8d36e8aa0a4d050daa1d/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/695f74e4e3ab9f7c4448908de5b0c1ff3ae1e78b/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-497.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-31.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/vulndb/vulns/jvn/2026/07/VW-2026-37578.yaml","https://github.com/skbnw/y_body/blob/0d181d3644386ae8bd7ac49df3aa0ce9b53dfe7b/2026-0804/20260804-scan.csv","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/e6720adb8b6bafb13f88b679ac0e19ce241b221f/news/2026/07/2026-07-29.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/data/vendors/jvn/advisories/2026/https-jvn.jp-vu-jvnvu98815601/advisory.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/5b70e3548ecb3b7fb4c680108057261c6ec7c238/data/vendors/jvn-ipedia-ipa/advisories/2026/https-jvndb.jvn.jp-en-contents-2026-jvndb-2026-026086.html/advisory.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0807.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0361","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15660","title":"Synology DiskStation DS925+ MailPlus Redis 弱密码学远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Synology DiskStation DS925+ 的 MailPlus 组件中 Redis 实例存在弱加密漏洞。在存储密码时，系统使用可恢复的加密格式处理凭据，导致加密强度不足。未经身份认证的网络邻近攻击者可利用此漏洞恢复敏感凭据信息，进而以 root 权限在目标设备上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Synology DSM、SRM、Surveillance Station 等多个产品线，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Synology 已在安全公告 Synology_SA_26_11 中发布修复更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15660"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Synology MailPlus Server 升级至修复版本：DSM 7.3 用户升级到 4.0.1-31663 或更高版本，DSM 7.2.2/7.2.1 用户升级到 4.0.1-21663 或更高版本。可通过 Package Center 手动检查更新并安装。该漏洞源于 MailPlus Redis 实例使用弱加密算法存储密码，相邻网络攻击者无需认证即可利用，获取 root 权限执行任意代码。官方未提供临时缓解措施，必须升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2026/07/2026-07-01-report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-423.json","https://github.com/f-peng/f-peng.github.io/blob/857f904764859fc1de2e6d1b686eca29365d06b3/content/cyber/blog_2026-07-02.md","https://github.com/dedsec-terminal/dedsec-terminal.github.io/blob/6b0554bdfdb9df7944733bf9d2c64bef3b0360a1/content/posts/synologyissuescriticalfixformailplusservervulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/synology/2026/07/VW-2026-18692.yaml","https://github.com/gcp-lopo/hacker-news-ai-pages/blob/1e3425b5f1430cdaa222157462695593cb2f609a/archives/2026-06-30/index.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/06/2026-06-26.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2026/07/2026-07-01-raw.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0348","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0348.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"汉王 e脸通综合管理平台 uploadMeetingFile.do 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"汉王e脸通综合管理平台 uploadMeetingFile.do 接口存在任意文件上传漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该接口上传特制恶意文件，绕过文件类型过滤限制，将 Webshell 或恶意脚本上传至服务器，从而获取服务器控制权限，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响汉王e脸通综合管理平台相关版本，危害严重，建议用户尽快联系厂商获取修复方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-05f190c9"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级汉王e脸通综合管理平台至最新版本，或在应用服务器层面限制 uploadMeetingFile.do 接口的访问权限，仅允许可信 IP 访问；同时配置严格的文件类型白名单校验（仅允许图片/文档类扩展名），并禁用上传目录的脚本执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0346","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0346.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"泛微 e-office block_content.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"泛微 eoffice 的 `/general/new_mytable/block_content.php` 接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者通过向 `block_id` 参数传入恶意构造的 UNION 查询语句，可绕过认证直接获取数据库中敏感信息，包括管理员凭证、用户数据等。该漏洞无需身份验证即可远程利用，攻击门槛低，影响部署了泛微 eoffice 的各类企业办公系统，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-05e4e86b"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级至泛微 e-office 最新版本（≥9.5），官方已修复 block_content.php 中 block_id 参数的 SQL 注入问题。如无法升级，需在应用层对 block_id 参数进行严格的白名单校验，仅允许纯数字输入，并部署 WAF 规则拦截注入 payload。同时建议将数据库连接账户权限降为最小，禁用 xp_cmdshell 等高危功能作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0346.toml"}]